===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|bīzan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*bītaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰeyd-||to split}}. Cognate with Low German {{term|bieten|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|bijten|lang=nl}}, English {{term|bite|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|bide|lang=da}}, Swedish {{term|bita|lang=sv}}.

===Pronunciation===
